  </div>
  <p class="prose">When Anthony shares real reviews, replace these cards and keep the sample labels off the live site.</p>
  <div class="btn-row">
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">Contact</a>
  </div>
</div>
